@model CSD.Treasury.Service.cmpBranch_EmailAddressService.cmpBranch_EmailAddress

@using (Ajax.BeginForm("CreateEmail", "BranchInfo", new { area = "BasicInfo" }, new AjaxOptions
{
    HttpMethod = "Post",
    OnSuccess = "updateTable('emailList'); successMessage(data)"
}, null))
{
    @Html.Hidden("cmpBranchID", (int)ViewBag.BranchId)
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-1"> 
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-success btn-flat btn-xs"><i class="zmdi zmdi-plus"></i></button>
        </div>
        <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-6">
            @Html.TextBoxFor(model => model.cmpBranchEmailAddress, new { @class = "form-control floating-label", placeholder = "ایمیل" })
        </div>
    </div>
}


@Scripts.Render("~/bundles/jqueryval")
<script>
    $(function () {
        $.material.init();
    });
</script>